WEBVTT

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:32.216
The courage to stand
with other vagabonds in the street,

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.616
with all the wretched of the earth,

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.456
to form an army of the least of these,

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:41.816
with the faith that from
the naked crust of all we are,

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:44.160
we can build a better world.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:46.136
Thank you.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:50.760
(Applause)